  Text: "It's quite deserted. So we got lucky on that one. \n \nNothing much to see
    except for a 24/7 <link>Petro Station</link>, which happens to be just 20 (twenty)
    feet away from the <link>ill-fated truck</link> that we are currently trying
    to hide from everyone's eyes. \n \nSo that's where our luck ends. \n\n\nIt's
    quite deserted. We got lucky on that one.\n \nNot much around except a <link>24/7
    Petro Station</link>, which happens to be about twenty feet from the <link>truck</link>
    that we are trying to keep out of sight. \nThat's where our luck ends. \n \n<link>Some
    small vehicle</link> passed through here earlier, leaving a   <link>three-wheeled
    trail</link> on some <link>radioactive-looking green goo</link> that leaked from
    <link>the cargo</link>. The smear stretches far down the road, in the same direction
    the truck appeared to be headed."
  TextForRepetition: 'We already did that, remember?

    The report is probably
    on your desk, or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
